  m_Name: Carta_TermosDeUso
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Termos de Uso
  _titleEn: Terms of Use
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "As cl\xE1usulas do contrato de dados com a big tech chegam \xE0 mesa
    da prefeitura a cada turno. Ocupam tempo da gest\xE3o e n\xE3o melhoram nada
    na cidade."
  _summaryEn: The clauses of the data contract with the big tech company land on
    City Hall's desk every turn. They take up the administration's time and improve
    nothing in the city.
  _realWorld: "No projeto de Toronto, a proposta de um fundo independente para guardar
    os dados urbanos foi criticada por especialistas, e a ex-comiss\xE1ria de privacidade
    de Ont\xE1rio, Ann Cavoukian, deixou o cargo de consultora do projeto."
  _realWorldEn: In the Toronto project, the proposal for an independent trust to
    hold urban data was criticized by experts, and Ontario's former privacy commissioner,
    Ann Cavoukian, quit her role as the project's adviser.
  _tradeOffs: Ler e negociar termos custa caro; aceitar sem ler custa mais tarde.
  _tradeOffsEn: Reading and negotiating terms is costly; accepting without reading
    costs more later.
  _sources:
  - Label: Sidewalk Toronto (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sidewalk_Toronto
